	"#str_41604"	"Warm-up"
	"#str_41605"	"Holds the match in warm-up until the configured readiness requirements are met."
	"#str_41606"	"Readiness Policy"
	"#str_41607"	"Chooses whether players, teams, both, or neither must declare ready."
